        {
          "text": "Gains Low-Altitude Hovering",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Autumn's Bounty] Summons a Delusion that has similar abilities to 'Ya' and also applies 'Winter's Void' to tiles it travels over. When 'Ya' is defeated, the Delusion also dies; if the Delusion dies, 'Ya' loses a percentage of Its max HP",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Slice the Seasons] 'Ya' and Delusion deal AoE damage, then switch places and routes",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Worldly Self] 'Ya' and Delusion deal AoE damage to surrounding units",
